    "Starting your studies – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nStarting your studies\nFall Semester 2026\nThe fall semester officially starts on Monday, August 10. In order to help you get off to the best start possible, the International Office will host a mandatory information meeting for all exchange students at the beginning of the semester.\nThis page will be updated with important information about the semester start. We look forward to welcoming our new exchange students in August!\nUseful links\nAcademic calender\nHow to get here\nCheck your online schedule!\n27\n.\nOct.\n'Belgian' Board Games\n12:00 PM,\nThe Tower, SiØ Housing\nComplete overview of all upcoming events for exchange students."
